  "functions": [
    {
      "id": "main",
      "layout": 1,
      "entry": "main:opening-start",
      "params": [],
      "locals": [],
      "returns": "void",
      "code": [
        {
          "at": "main:opening-start",
          "object": {
            "id": "background",
            "asset": "shore",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "alpha": 1
            },
            "z": 0
          },
          "op": "stage.put"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:lamp",
          "object": {
            "id": "light",
            "asset": "lamp",
            "position": {
              "x": 910,
              "y": 75,
              "alpha": 0
            },
            "z": 1
          },
          "op": "stage.put"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:letter",
          "object": {
            "id": "letter",
            "asset": "envelope",
            "position": {
              "x": 170,
              "y": 380,
              "alpha": 1
            },
            "z": 2
          },
          "op": "stage.put"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:music",
          "task": "music",
          "asset": "bgm",
          "channel": "bgm",
          "gain": 0.3,
          "loop": true,
          "restore": "replay",
          "op": "audio.play"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:opening-1",
          "textId": "opening.1",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "澪",
          "content": "潮水退去时，我在旧码头拾到一封没有邮戳的信。信封上，写着我的名字。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:opening-2",
          "textId": "opening.2",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "澪",
          "content": "「请在灯亮以前，替我读完它。」澪把信递过来，远处的塔还沉在暮色里。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:prepare",
          "function": "prepareSignal",
          "args": [
            {
              "literal": {
                "kind": "i32",
                "value": 0
              }
            }
          ],
          "dest": "visits",
          "op": "control.call"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:opening-3",
          "textId": "opening.3",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "澪",
          "content": "我照着信上的记号拨动开关。第一束光穿过海雾，信纸上的字也慢慢清晰。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:fade",
          "task": "fade",
          "id": "light",
          "to": {
            "x": 910,
            "y": 75,
            "alpha": 1
          },
          "duration": 400,
          "policy": "reject",
          "op": "stage.animate"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:move",
          "task": "move",
          "id": "letter",
          "to": {
            "x": 500,
            "y": 300,
            "alpha": 1
          },
          "duration": 1200,
          "policy": "reject",
          "op": "stage.animate"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:effects-join",
          "group": "signal",
          "members": [
            "fade",
            "move"
          ],
          "op": "task.join"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:route-choice",
          "dest": "route",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "shore",
              "text": "沿着海岸，寻找寄信人",
              "target": "shore:start"
            },
            {
              "id": "tower",
              "text": "走进灯塔，守候下一束光",
              "target": "tower:start"
            }
          ],
          "op": "choice"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:start",
          "object": {
            "id": "background",
            "asset": "shore",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "alpha": 1
            },
            "z": 0
          },
          "op": "stage.put"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:sound",
          "task": "shore-voice",
          "asset": "voice-shore",
          "channel": "voice",
          "gain": 0.65,
          "loop": false,
          "restore": "stop",
          "op": "audio.play"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:page-1",
          "textId": "shore.1",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "碎贝壳在鞋底轻响。澪说，每一封没能送出的信，都会在这片海停留。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:page-2",
          "textId": "shore.2",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "我们在防波堤后找到一只铁盒。里面没有地址，只有一张两个人的合影。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:page-3",
          "textId": "shore.3",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "「原来，等信的人也可以先出发。」她笑着，把空白的背面朝向我。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:page-4",
          "textId": "shore.4",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "我写下今天的日期。海风不再催促，潮水替我们收好了最后一句话。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:ending",
          "textId": "ending.shore",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "海岸结局 · 寄出的明天\n我们把回信装进铁盒，约好下一次退潮再见。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:unlock",
          "key": "shoreUnlocked",
          "value": {
            "kind": "bool",
            "value": true
          },
          "op": "profile.set"
        },
        {
          "at": "shore:to-epilogue",
          "target": "main:epilogue",
          "op": "control.jump"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:start",
          "object": {
            "id": "background",
            "asset": "tower",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "alpha": 1
            },
            "z": 0
          },
          "op": "stage.put"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:sound",
          "task": "tower-voice",
          "asset": "voice-tower",
          "channel": "voice",
          "gain": 0.65,
          "loop": false,
          "restore": "stop",
          "op": "audio.play"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:page-1",
          "textId": "tower.1",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "塔里的阶梯比想象中长。每上一层，海面的声音就轻一点。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:page-2",
          "textId": "tower.2",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "控制室的桌上放着一本值班簿，最后一页写着：「灯亮着，就有人能回家。」",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:page-3",
          "textId": "tower.3",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "澪打开窗。我把信放在灯下，看见纸背还有一行很小的字。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:page-4",
          "textId": "tower.4",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "「谢谢你来。」没有落款。我想，这已经足够。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:ending",
          "textId": "ending.tower",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "灯塔结局 · 留灯的人\n我们轮流守着那束光，直到远处传来船笛。",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:unlock",
          "key": "towerUnlocked",
          "value": {
            "kind": "bool",
            "value": true
          },
          "op": "profile.set"
        },
        {
          "at": "tower:to-epilogue",
          "target": "main:epilogue",
          "op": "control.jump"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:epilogue",
          "textId": "epilogue",
          "revision": "zh-1",
          "speaker": "灯塔来信",
          "content": "夜色落下，灯塔仍在回信。\n《灯塔来信》· 完",
          "op": "text.page"
        },
        {
          "at": "main:end",
          "op": "control.end"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
